  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1901.04 \"Certificate of title\" means a formal document issued by the division of motor vehicles which constitutes evidence of a person's legal ownership of a vehicle. The term includes \"title\".\n\nSource. #8339, eff 4-26-05 (from Saf-C 1902.03); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12 eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23 (formerly Saf-C 1901.03)",
